       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Berylliosis:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " corticosteroid-sparing therapy (methotrexate or infliximab) is chosen as in sarcoidosis."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "CI:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " doses > 5 mg/kg in moderate or severe heart failure; prior severe hypersensitivity to infliximab or murine proteins."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Boxed warning:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " serious infections (TB, bacterial sepsis, invasive fungal, opportunistic) leading to hospitalization or death; stop for a serious infection. HBV reactivation in carriers. Severe hepatotoxicity: stop for jaundice or marked LFT rise. New or worsening heart failure. Cytopenias. Serious infusion reactions incl. anaphylaxis or serum sickness. Demyelinating disease. Lupus-like syndrome (stop drug)."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Test for latent TB before starting and periodically; treat latent TB first. Monitor for active TB even if the initial test was negative. Test for HBV before starting; monitor carriers during and for months after."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "TNF blocker + abatacept or anakinra:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " more serious infections; combination not recommended."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Bring vaccinations up to date before starting; no live vaccines during therapy."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
